cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below, together with EVo (Liggins et al. 2020, 2022) and dMODELS (Battaglia et al. 2013)."
title: "La Fossa (Vulcano) - from magma compressibility to surface uplift"
abstract: >-
  Google Colab notebook coupling the EVo C-O-H-S degassing code to the Mogi, Yang and Fialko
  deformation sources (dMODELS) to predict surface uplift at La Fossa volcano (Vulcano Island, Italy)
  from measured melt compositions and volatile budgets, via the volume-partitioning factor
  r_V = 1 + beta_m/beta_c. Accompanies the MSc thesis "From magma compressibility to surface
  deformation at La Fossa volcano (Vulcano Island, Italy)".
type: software
